[833] = "無法使用",
-- d580a703 English: Enhancement (Icy Veins)
-- Context: Name of a Built In rotation for TBC Shaman, Enhancement spec, based on an Icy Veins
--     guide; a trailing site name in parentheses.
[834] = "增強（Icy Veins）",
-- a97cd0b7 English: Melee Enhancement from level 1 to 70, and the default for any Shaman no other
--     premade fits. Pulls with Lightning Bolt from range, interrupts with Earth Shock, drops Fire
--     Nova and Magma Totems on three or more nearby enemies, then Stormstrike, Earth Shock while
--     Stormstrike's debuff is up, Flame Shock on a target that will live, Earth Shock on cooldown,
--     and Lightning Bolt while the target is out of reach. Separate reminders: weapon imbues, Water
--     or Lightning Shield, Strength of Earth, Windfury (group) or Grace of Air (solo), Searing on
--     long fights, water totems, Shamanistic Rage, Bloodlust/Heroism on bosses, Stoneclaw and Earth
--     Elemental when solo. Fire Elemental is an optional step that starts off. Totem placement,
--     Ghost Wolf and healing stay with you.
[835] = "增強近戰，適用於 1 至 70 級，也是沒有其他內建循環適用時所有薩滿的預設循環。從遠處以閃電箭拉怪，以地震術中斷施法，附近有三個以上敵人時放下火焰新星圖騰與熔岩圖騰，接著是風暴打擊、風暴打擊的減益效果存在時使用地震術、對會存活較久的目標使用烈焰震擊、冷卻結束即使用地震術，以及目標不在攻擊範圍內時使用閃電箭。獨立提醒：武器灌注、水之盾或閃電之盾、大地之力圖騰、風怒圖騰（隊伍中）或風之優雅圖騰（單人）、長時間戰鬥時的灼熱圖騰、水之圖騰、薩滿之怒、首領戰時的嗜血術/英勇氣概、單人時的石爪圖騰與土元素圖騰。火元素圖騰是預設關閉的選擇性步驟。圖騰擺放、鬼魂之狼與治療由你自行處理。",
-- 7637d9eb English: Enhancement (Wowhead & wowsims)
[836] = "增強（Wowhead & wowsims）",
-- 1ec4e078 English: The level-70 raid model for totem twisting, an alternative to the recommended
--     Icy Veins Enhancement premade, off by default: enable it and disable that one, or raise its
--     priority. Stormstrike, a Fire Nova Totem weave, Flame Shock whenever it has fallen off, and
--     Earth Shock as the main shock, with Lightning Bolt only out of reach. Reminders twist
--     Windfury and Grace of Air Totems, keep Searing down, use Shamanistic Rage when mana runs low,
--     and share the Icy Veins variant's imbue, shield and totem upkeep.
[837] = "70 級團隊副本的圖騰輪替模型，作為推薦的 Icy Veins 增強內建循環的替代，預設為停用：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。風暴打擊、穿插火焰新星圖騰、烈焰震擊一消失就重新施放、以地震術作為主要震擊，只有在目標超出攻擊範圍時才使用閃電箭。提醒會輪替風怒圖騰與風之優雅圖騰、維持灼熱圖騰，在法力不足時使用薩滿之怒，並與 Icy Veins 版本共用武器灌注、護盾與圖騰維持提醒。",
-- 3a3fe11d English: Elemental (Icy Veins & wowsims)
[838] = "元素（Icy Veins & wowsims）",
-- c334526c English: Caster Elemental for the Elemental talent tree. Lightning Bolt is the filler;
--     Chain Lightning goes out with Elemental Mastery, on Clearcasting while you have 40% mana, or
--     freely above 80%; Flame Shock only while moving; Earth Shock interrupts; Fire Nova, Chain
--     Lightning and Magma for packs. Before Chain Lightning a target in melee is left to
--     auto-attack to save mana. Reminders: Water or Lightning Shield, a weapon imbue, Totem of
--     Wrath (or Searing on long fights), Wrath of Air, Mana Spring, Totemic Call after the fight,
--     Elemental Mastery and Bloodlust/Heroism.
[839] = "針對元素天賦樹的施法型元素。閃電箭為填充技能；閃電鏈在精通元素期間、法力至少 40% 時的節能施法期間，或法力高於 80% 時自由施放；烈焰震擊只在移動時使用；地震術用於中斷；成群敵人時使用火焰新星、閃電鏈與熔岩圖騰。在閃電鏈之前，若目標位於近戰範圍內，就交由自動攻擊處理以節省法力。提醒：水之盾或閃電之盾、武器灌注、憤怒圖騰（長時間戰鬥則用灼熱圖騰）、風懲圖騰、法力之泉圖騰、戰鬥後的圖騰的呼喚、精通元素以及嗜血術/英勇氣概。",
-- 6c2dcf2e English: Elemental (Wowhead)
-- Context: Name of a Built In rotation for TBC Shaman, Elemental spec, based on a Wowhead guide;
--     the site name is in parentheses.
[840] = "元素（Wowhead）",
-- c4c0aa4c English: Wowhead's Elemental, an alternative to the recommended Icy Veins Elemental
--     premade, off by default: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. At 70 Chain
--     Lightning on cooldown with Lightning Bolts in between (while leveling only with Elemental
--     Mastery or Clearcasting), Flame Shock only while moving, Earth Shock to finish a target that
--     would die before a cast lands. Same totem, shield and cooldown reminders as the Icy Veins
--     variant.
[841] = "Wowhead 的元素，作為推薦的 Icy Veins 元素內建循環的替代，預設為停用：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。70 級時閃電鏈冷卻結束即施放，其間穿插閃電箭（升級期間只在精通元素或節能施法時施放閃電鏈），烈焰震擊只在移動時使用，以地震術收掉會在施法完成前死亡的目標。圖騰、護盾與冷卻技能提醒與 Icy Veins 版本相同。",
-- bb13bf18 English: Elemental (NextActionTBC)
-- Context: Name of a Built In rotation for TBC Shaman, Elemental spec, based on the NextActionTBC
--     addon's logic; the source is in parentheses.
[842] = "元素（NextActionTBC）",
-- 2ec2f692 English: NextActionTBC's Elemental, an alternative to the recommended Icy Veins
--     Elemental premade, off by default: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority.
--     Keeps Flame Shock on the target, Chain Lightning only against two or more enemies while above
--     30% mana, Lightning Bolt otherwise. Reminds you of Lightning Shield, a weapon imbue,
--     Elemental Mastery and Bloodlust/Heroism; totems stay manual.
[843] = "NextActionTBC 的元素，作為推薦的 Icy Veins 元素內建循環的替代，預設為停用：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。維持目標身上的烈焰震擊，只有在面對兩個以上敵人且法力高於 30% 時才使用閃電鏈，否則使用閃電箭。會提醒你閃電之盾、武器灌注、精通元素以及嗜血術/英勇氣概；圖騰由你手動處理。",
-- 6a3c6c77 English: Restoration
-- Context: Name of a Built In rotation for TBC Shaman, Restoration spec (the spec name
--     Restoration).
[844] = "恢復",
-- e6f434e0 English: Healing for the Restoration talent tree, on your friendly target (or yourself
--     with no target): Nature's Swiftness and Healing Wave or Lesser Healing Wave in emergencies,
--     Cure Poison and Cure Disease, Earth Shield on your focus, Chain Heal when three nearby allies
--     are hurt, Healing Wave otherwise. With a hostile target it switches to Flame Shock and
--     Lightning Bolt for soloing. Reminders: Water Shield, Earth Shield on your focus (set the tank
--     as focus), Mana Tide, Mana Spring and Strength of Earth in a group, Bloodlust/Heroism.
--     Choosing whom to heal and which rank stays with you.
[845] = "恢復天賦樹的治療，作用於你的友方目標（沒有目標時則是你自己）：緊急時使用自然迅捷搭配治療波或次級治療波、消毒術與祛病術、對你的專注目標施放大地之盾，附近有三名盟友受傷時使用治療鍊，否則使用治療波。目標為敵對時改用烈焰震擊與閃電箭來單人練功。提醒：水之盾、對專注目標施放大地之盾（請將坦克設為專注目標）、法力之潮圖騰、隊伍中的法力之泉圖騰與大地之力圖騰、嗜血術/英勇氣概。要治療誰以及使用哪個等級由你決定。",
