-- e5b321d7 English: Melee DPS
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Rogue, WoW
--     Forever (variant key: DPS).
[1937] = "近戰 DPS",
-- f8f8f256 English: Melee damage for every Rogue specialization from level 1 to 60, built from Icy
--     Veins, Wowhead and Warcraft Tavern. The builder follows what you know: Mutilate (Sinister
--     Strike for the fifth point), Hemorrhage, Backstab when the target is not facing you, else
--     Sinister Strike. From Stealth it opens with Premeditation, Cheap Shot when solo, Garrote for
--     Subtlety on group elites, else Ambush or Garrote. It keeps Slice and Dice and Venom up, uses
--     Expose Armor in groups on elites when no warrior has five Sunders, then spends five points on
--     Rupture (Subtlety, long fights) or Eviscerate, and never builds past five. Reminders: poisons
--     on each weapon, Kick, Blade Flurry and Adrenaline Rush on packs and elites, Cold Blood,
--     Evasion, Feint, Thistle Tea and Preparation. Left to you: Vanish, Sprint, Kidney Shot, Blind,
--     Sap and positioning. Forever restricts combat data, so Rotation Master lists this premade for
--     reference and does not select it automatically yet.
[1938] = "適用於所有盜賊專精 1 至 60 級的近戰傷害，綜合 Icy Veins、Wowhead 與 Warcraft Tavern。累積連擊點技能取決於你已學會的技能：截肢（第五個連擊點用邪惡攻擊）、出血、目標未面向你時使用背刺，否則使用邪惡攻擊。潛行時以預謀起手，單人時偷襲，隊伍中面對精英時敏銳使用絞喉，否則使用伏擊或絞喉。維持切割與毒液，隊伍中對精英且沒有戰士疊滿五層破甲攻擊時使用破甲，然後把五個連擊點用於割裂（敏銳，長時間戰鬥）或剔骨，且絕不累積超過五點。提醒：每把武器上的毒藥、腳踢、對怪群與精英使用劍刃亂舞與能量刺激、冷血、閃避、佯攻、菊花茶與伺機待發。由你自行處理：消失、疾跑、腎擊、致盲、悶棍與站位。永久限制了戰鬥資料，因此 Rotation Master 只將此內建循環列出供參考，目前還不會自動選用。",
-- 3333c1f0 English: Subtlety, Ambush build (Warcraft Tavern)
[1939] = "敏銳，伏擊流（Warcraft Tavern）",
-- 776899da English: Warcraft Tavern's Ambush/Cutthroat Subtlety build: Premeditation and Ambush on
--     every opener, Ambush again whenever Cutthroat allows it, Backstab from behind as the builder
--     (Hemorrhage when the target is facing you), Ghostly Strike on cooldown, and Slice and Dice
--     then Eviscerate at five points with no Rupture. Reminds you to Vanish for another Ambush on a
--     tanked boss. Choose it instead of the recommended Rogue premade if you took the Cutthroat
--     talents; it applies with Subtlety as your main talent tree and Cutthroat talented. Same
--     poison and cooldown reminders as the recommended premade. An alternative to the recommended
--     Rogue DPS premade, off by default: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority.
[1940] = "Warcraft Tavern 的伏擊/割喉敏銳流派：每次起手都用預謀與伏擊，割喉允許時再次伏擊，以背後的背刺作為累積連擊點技能（目標面向你時用出血），鬼魅攻擊冷卻結束即使用，切割，然後在五個連擊點時使用剔骨，不使用割裂。會提醒你在首領被坦克拉住時消失以再次伏擊。如果你點了割喉天賦，請選擇它而非推薦的盜賊內建循環；它在以敏銳作為主要天賦樹且已點出割喉時適用。毒藥與冷卻技能提醒與推薦的內建循環相同。這是推薦的盜賊傷害輸出內建循環的替代選項，預設為停用：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。",
-- 208fc263 English: Subtlety, Garrote build (Wowhead)
[1941] = "敏銳，絞喉流（Wowhead）",
-- 919f756d English: Wowhead's Subtlety: Premeditation and Garrote on every opener, and Vanish (then
--     Preparation) used in the rotation to open with Garrote again once the last one has run out.
--     Slice and Dice kept up, Expose Armor in groups, Rupture as the five-point finisher,
--     Hemorrhage as the only builder. This spends Vanish, your escape, on damage: choose it
--     deliberately. It applies with Subtlety as your main talent tree, Dirty Deeds talented and
--     Premeditation known. Same poison and cooldown reminders as the recommended premade. An
--     alternative to the recommended Rogue DPS premade, off by default: enable it and disable that
--     one, or raise its priority.
[1942] = "Wowhead 的敏銳：每次起手都用預謀與絞喉，並在循環中使用消失（接著伺機待發），在上一次絞喉結束後再次以絞喉起手。維持切割，隊伍中使用破甲，割裂作為五連擊點終結技，出血是唯一的累積連擊點技能。這會把你的逃生技能消失用在輸出上：請審慎選擇。它在以敏銳作為主要天賦樹、已點出骯髒手段且已學會預謀時適用。毒藥與冷卻技能提醒與推薦的內建循環相同。這是推薦的盜賊傷害輸出內建循環的替代選項，預設為停用：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。",
-- 6a3c6c77 English: Restoration
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Shaman,
--     WoW Forever (variant key: Restoration).
[1943] = "恢復",
-- d54e5a0a English: Healing once Restoration is your main talent tree with 16 points (Mana Tide
--     Totem's tier), after Icy Veins. With a friendly target: an instant Healing Wave once you use
--     Nature's Swiftness, Cure Poison and Cure Disease, Riptide on a target without it, Chain Heal
--     in a group, Healing Wave. You pick who to heal by targeting them; health and mana are hidden
--     from addons on Forever, so when to use Nature's Swiftness and Lesser Healing Wave is your
--     call. With a hostile target and nothing to heal: Fire Nova and Chain Lightning on packs,
--     Stormstrike and Earth Shock if you know Stormstrike, Flame Shock on elites and bosses,
--     Lightning Bolt, then melee. Reminders: Water Shield, the Earth Shock interrupt, Mana Tide and
--     group buff totems. Left to you: downranking, other totems, Purge and Ghost Wolf.
[1944] = "當恢復是你的主要天賦樹且已投入 16 點（法力之潮圖騰所在層）後的治療，依據 Icy Veins。友方目標時：使用自然迅捷後施放瞬發治療波、消毒術與祛病術、對沒有激流的目標使用激流、隊伍中使用治療鍊，其餘使用治療波。透過選取目標來決定要治療誰；在永久版本中，插件看不到生命力與法力，因此何時使用自然迅捷與次級治療波由你決定。目標為敵對且無人需要治療時：怪群使用火焰新星與閃電鏈，若學會風暴打擊則使用風暴打擊與地震術，對精英與首領使用烈焰震擊、閃電箭，然後近戰。提醒：水之盾、地震術中斷、法力之潮圖騰與隊伍增益圖騰。由你自行處理：降級施法、其他圖騰、淨化術與幽魂之狼。",
-- 4309e83a English: Elemental
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Shaman,
--     WoW Forever (variant key: Elemental).
[1945] = "元素",
-- 2fcd0801 English: Ranged Elemental once Elemental is your main talent tree with 21 points (Lava
--     Burst's tier), after Icy Veins (before that the Enhancement premade plays the melee hybrid
--     every guide recommends). Pulls with Lightning Bolt (Chain Lightning on a pack), casts only
--     instants while moving, uses Fire Nova and Chain Lightning on three or more enemies, keeps
--     Flame Shock up, Lava Burst on cooldown, Stormstrike and Earth Shock if you know Stormstrike,
--     Fire Nova on Clearcasting in groups, then Lightning Bolt. Reminders: shield, weapon imbue,
--     Searing or Magma Totem, group totems, Elemental Mastery, interrupt. Health and mana are
--     hidden from addons on Forever, so healing yourself and pausing to refill mana are your call.
--     Left to you: Earthbind kiting, Frost Shock, Purge and other totems.
[1946] = "當元素是你的主要天賦樹且已投入 21 點（熔岩爆發所在層）後的遠程元素，依據 Icy Veins（在此之前，由增強內建循環執行所有指南都推薦的近戰混合打法）。以閃電箭拉怪（怪群時用閃電鏈），移動時只施放瞬發法術，三個以上敵人時使用火焰新星與閃電鏈，維持烈焰震擊，熔岩爆發冷卻結束即使用，若學會風暴打擊則使用風暴打擊與地震術，隊伍中節能施法觸發時使用火焰新星，然後是閃電箭。提醒：護盾、武器灌注、灼熱圖騰或熔岩圖騰、隊伍圖騰、精通元素、中斷施法。在永久版本中，插件看不到生命力與法力，因此治療自己與停下來回復法力由你決定。由你自行處理：以地縛圖騰放風箏、冰霜震擊、淨化術與其他圖騰。",
-- d580a703 English: Enhancement (Icy Veins)
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Shaman,
--     WoW Forever (variant key: Enhancement). Names in parentheses (guide or tool such as Icy
--     Veins, Wowhead, SimulationCraft, wowsims, Hekili, Mobalytics, Warcraft Tavern) are proper
--     names and stay unchanged.
[1947] = "增強（Icy Veins）",
-- 339ec7e4 English: Melee Enhancement from level 1 to 60, and the default for any Shaman before
--     Lava Burst or Mana Tide Totem. Pulls with Lightning Bolt from range, then Stormstrike on
--     cooldown, an instant Lightning Bolt at five Maelstrom Weapon stacks, Fire Nova (with a Fire
--     totem down) and Flame Shock on three or more enemies, Earth Shock into the Stormstrike
--     debuff, Flame Shock in groups, and Earth Shock on cooldown; Lightning Bolt fills the gap
--     while the target is out of reach. Health and mana are hidden from addons on Forever, so
--     healing yourself and pausing to refill mana are your call (the Wowhead premade saves mana
--     instead). Reminders: weapon imbue (Windfury, else Flametongue, else Rockbiter), Water or
--     Lightning Shield, the Earth Shock interrupt, Searing or Magma Totem, group totems, Rage of
--     the Farseer, Stoneclaw Totem. Left to you: totem presets, Frost Shock, Purge and other
--     totems.
[1948] = "增強近戰，適用於 1 至 60 級，也是學會熔岩爆發或法力之潮圖騰之前所有薩滿的預設循環。從遠處以閃電箭拉怪，接著風暴打擊冷卻結束即使用，氣漩武器疊滿五層時施放瞬發閃電箭，三個以上敵人時使用火焰新星（需已放下火焰圖騰）與烈焰震擊，在風暴打擊減益效果期間使用地震術，隊伍中使用烈焰震擊，以及地震術冷卻結束即使用；目標不在攻擊範圍內時以閃電箭填補空檔。在永久版本中，插件看不到生命力與法力，因此治療自己與停下來回復法力由你決定（Wowhead 內建循環則改為節省法力）。提醒：武器灌注（風怒武器，否則火舌武器，再否則石化武器）、水之盾或閃電之盾、地震術中斷、灼熱圖騰或熔岩圖騰、隊伍圖騰、先知之怒、石爪圖騰。由你自行處理：圖騰預設組合、冰霜震擊、淨化術與其他圖騰。",
-- eb2363b2 English: Enhancement, mana-efficient (Wowhead)
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Shaman,
--     WoW Forever (variant key: Enhancement / Wowhead). Names in parentheses (guide or tool such as
--     Icy Veins, Wowhead, SimulationCraft, wowsims, Hekili, Mobalytics, Warcraft Tavern) are proper
--     names and stay unchanged.
[1949] = "增強，節省法力（Wowhead）",
-- abc72f43 English: Wowhead's and Mobalytics' mana-saving Enhancement: auto-attack does the work,
--     Stormstrike only while Improved Stormstrike's mana regeneration is down, no Earth Shock in
--     the rotation (shocks pull and interrupt), and in groups or on packs Searing Totem with Fire
--     Nova on cooldown. Same imbue, shield and interrupt reminders as the Icy Veins premade. Choose
--     it instead of that premade if mana runs out. An alternative to the recommended Enhancement
--     premade, off by default: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority.
[1950] = "Wowhead 與 Mobalytics 的節省法力增強：主要靠自動攻擊輸出，只在強化風暴打擊的法力回復效果不在時使用風暴打擊，循環中不使用地震術（震擊用於拉怪與中斷），隊伍中或面對怪群時使用灼熱圖騰，並在冷卻結束時使用火焰新星。武器灌注、護盾與中斷提醒與 Icy Veins 內建循環相同。如果你的法力不夠用，請選擇它而非那個內建循環。這是推薦的增強內建循環的替代選項，預設為停用：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。",
-- 7e8fd1de English: All trees
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Warlock,
--     WoW Forever (variant key: DPS).
[1951] = "所有天賦樹",
-- 157e4fa1 English: Every Warlock talent tree from level 1 to 60, merged from Icy Veins, Wowhead
--     and Method; the steps for a tree appear once you know its talent spells. Pulls with Immolate
--     and Bane of Agony (Destruction precasts Shadow Bolt), uses Nightfall and Decimation procs,
--     keeps Demonic Brand up with Searing Pain. While moving it casts only instants. On packs:
--     Hellfire in a group, Rain of Fire, Corruption and Agony. Then Bane of Doom on elites and
--     bosses or Bane of Agony, Curse of the Elements in groups and on elites, Immolate, Corruption,
--     Siphon Life, Conflagrate and Shadowburn; solo it fills with Wrack, Drain Life (with a drain
--     talent) or the wand; otherwise Incinerate or Shadow Bolt. Reminders: armor, a demon
--     (Succubus, else Voidwalker, else Imp), Fel Domination, Demonic Sacrifice with Demonic Pact,
--     Soul Link, weapon stones, Amplify Curse and Bane of Havoc for a second enemy. Left to you:
--     sending the pet in, other curses, Fear, Healthstones and other targets. Health and mana are
--     hidden from addons on Forever, so the execute window (Drain Soul, Shadowburn as the killing
--     blow), Life Tap, Health Funnel and draining when hurt are your call.
[1952] = "適用於 1 至 60 級的所有術士天賦樹，綜合 Icy Veins、Wowhead 與 Method；某個天賦樹的步驟會在你學會它的天賦法術後出現。以獻祭與痛苦災厄拉怪（毀滅預先施放暗影箭），利用夜幕與屠虐的觸發，以灼熱之痛維持惡魔烙印。移動時只施放瞬發法術。怪群時：隊伍中地獄烈焰、火焰之雨、腐蝕術與痛苦災厄。接著對精英與首領使用末日災厄，否則使用痛苦災厄，隊伍中與對精英使用元素詛咒，獻祭、腐蝕術、生命虹吸、焚燒與暗影灼燒；單人時以毀壞、吸取生命（需有吸取天賦）或魔杖填充；否則使用燒盡或暗影箭。提醒：護甲、一隻惡魔（魅魔，否則虛空行者，再否則小鬼）、惡魔支配、搭配惡魔契印的惡魔犧牲、靈魂鏈結、武器石、詛咒增幅以及對第二個敵人使用浩劫之禍。由你自行處理：派寵物攻擊、其他詛咒、恐懼術、治療石與其他目標。在永久版本中，插件看不到生命力與法力，因此斬殺階段（吸取靈魂、以暗影灼燒作為致命一擊）、生命分流、生命通道與受傷時吸取都由你決定。",
-- 8283f17a English: All trees (Icy Veins)
[1953] = "所有天賦樹（Icy Veins）",
-- 8573424f English: Icy Veins' Warlock leveling: the wand is the solo filler, Voidwalker is the
--     default demon, Affliction and Destruction sacrifice their demon and play without one (from 41
--     and 55), Demonology keeps Demonic Brand up and uses Immolate only as a filler, and
--     Destruction puts Bane of Havoc on the durable enemy of a pack and Conflagrates on cooldown
--     once Incinerate is known. Choose it instead of the recommended Warlock premade if you follow
--     Icy Veins. Health, mana and time to die are hidden from addons on Forever, so Drain Life when
--     hurt, Life Tap and which targets will live long enough for DoTs are your call. An alternative
--     to the recommended Warlock DPS premade, off by default: enable it and disable that one, or
--     raise its priority.
[1954] = "Icy Veins 的術士升級打法：魔杖是單人時的填充，虛空行者是預設惡魔，痛苦與毀滅會犧牲惡魔並在沒有惡魔的情況下作戰（分別從 41 級與 55 級起），惡魔學識維持惡魔烙印，且只把獻祭當作填充，毀滅在學會燒盡後，會對怪群中最耐打的敵人施放浩劫之禍，並在冷卻結束時使用焚燒。如果你遵循 Icy Veins，請選擇它而非推薦的術士內建循環。在永久版本中，插件看不到生命力、法力與剩餘存活時間，因此受傷時吸取生命、生命分流，以及哪些目標能活得夠久而值得上持續傷害效果，都由你決定。這是推薦的術士傷害輸出內建循環的替代選項，預設為停用：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。",
-- b9f016be English: All trees (Wowhead)
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Warlock,
--     WoW Forever (variant key: DPS / Wowhead). Names in parentheses (guide or tool such as Icy
--     Veins, Wowhead, SimulationCraft, wowsims, Hekili, Mobalytics, Warcraft Tavern) are proper
--     names and stay unchanged.
[1955] = "所有天賦樹（Wowhead）",
-- 02cc5c3e English: Wowhead's level-30 Warlock: Affliction and Demonology drain-tank with the
--     Succubus (Corruption and Agony, no Immolate, then Drain Life for the rest of the fight;
--     health and mana are hidden on Forever, so Life Tap is your call), Demonology keeps Demonic
--     Brand up and Agonies only big targets, Destruction puts Agony, Corruption and Immolate on
--     every mob, Conflagrates just before Immolate ends, saves Shadowburn for the killing blow and
--     wands with the Voidwalker. Amplify Curse on every cooldown; Curse of the Elements and Bane of
--     Doom only on elites and bosses; no pack section. Wowhead's guides stop at level 30. An
--     alternative to the recommended Warlock DPS premade, off by default: enable it and disable
--     that one, or raise its priority.
[1956] = "Wowhead 的 30 級術士：痛苦與惡魔學識帶著魅魔進行吸血坦打法（腐蝕術與痛苦災厄，不用獻祭，接著在剩餘戰鬥中使用吸取生命；在永久版本中生命力與法力是隱藏的，因此生命分流由你決定），惡魔學識維持惡魔烙印，且只對高血量目標施放痛苦災厄，毀滅對每隻怪物施放痛苦災厄、腐蝕術與獻祭，在獻祭結束前使用焚燒，把暗影灼燒留作最後一擊，並帶著虛空行者使用魔杖。詛咒增幅每次冷卻結束即使用；元素詛咒與末日災厄只用於精英與首領；沒有怪群部分。Wowhead 的指南只寫到 30 級。這是推薦的術士傷害輸出內建循環的替代選項，預設為停用：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。",
-- 80b938a1 English: Protection (Icy Veins)
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Warrior,
--     WoW Forever (variant key: Protection). Names in parentheses (guide or tool such as Icy Veins,
--     Wowhead, SimulationCraft, wowsims, Hekili, Mobalytics, Warcraft Tavern) are proper names and
--     stay unchanged.
[1957] = "防護（Icy Veins）",
-- 95bdeac5 English: Tanking whenever you are in Defensive Stance, from level 10 to 60. Charges to
--     pull (in Defensive Stance once you have Vanguard), Victory Rush, and on two or more enemies
--     Thunder Clap on cooldown, Demoralizing Shout, Shield Slam, Revenge and Rend. On one target:
--     Shield Slam, Revenge, Demoralizing Shout, Rend, Sunder Armor (five on elites) and Thunder
--     Clap on dangerous targets. Reminders: Battle Shout, Bloodrage, Shield Bash, Shield Block
--     while you hold the target, Heroic Strike while Shield Slam and Revenge are both recovering,
--     Cleave on packs; Taunt and Shield Wall are listed but off. Rage, health and the target's mana
--     are hidden from addons on Forever, so the rage thresholds, casters and Last Stand are your
--     call. Left to you: swapping to Battle Stance to Charge before Vanguard, taunting other
--     enemies and picking up loose ones.
[1958] = "10 至 60 級，只要你處於防禦姿態就作為坦克循環。以衝鋒拉怪（擁有守禦先鋒後可在防禦姿態下衝鋒）、勝利衝擊，兩個以上敵人時雷霆一擊冷卻結束即使用、挫志怒吼、盾牌猛擊、復仇與撕裂。單一目標時：盾牌猛擊、復仇、挫志怒吼、撕裂、破甲攻擊（對精英疊五層），以及對危險目標使用雷霆一擊。提醒：戰鬥怒吼、血性狂暴、盾擊、你持有目標仇恨時的盾牌格擋、盾牌猛擊與復仇都在恢復時的英勇打擊，以及怪群時的順劈斬；嘲諷與盾牆已列出但預設關閉。在永久版本中，插件看不到怒氣、生命力與目標的法力，因此怒氣門檻、施法者與破釜沉舟由你決定。由你自行處理：學會守禦先鋒之前切換到戰鬥姿態衝鋒、嘲諷其他敵人以及拉回跑掉的敵人。",
-- 79d0620e English: Protection, debuff upkeep (Warcraft Tavern)
[1959] = "防護，維持減益（Warcraft Tavern）",
-- f36ad073 English: Warcraft Tavern's tanking order: Thunder Clap, Demoralizing Shout and five
--     Sunder Armors kept on every target first, then Revenge, Rend and Shield Slam last, with
--     Heroic Strike or Cleave whenever you can afford them (rage is hidden on Forever, so there is
--     no 60-rage threshold). No Shield Block or defensive reminders. Choose it instead of the Icy
--     Veins tank premade if you prefer to keep the debuffs up first. An alternative to the
--     recommended Protection premade, off by default: enable it and disable that one, or raise its
--     priority.
[1960] = "Warcraft Tavern 的坦克順序：先在每個目標上維持雷霆一擊、挫志怒吼與五層破甲攻擊，然後是復仇、撕裂，最後是盾牌猛擊，只要負擔得起就使用英勇打擊或順劈斬（永久版本中怒氣是隱藏的，因此沒有 60 怒氣的門檻）。沒有盾牌格擋或防禦提醒。如果你偏好先維持減益效果，請選擇它而非 Icy Veins 坦克內建循環。這是推薦的防護內建循環的替代選項，預設為停用：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。",
-- 823b4c3f English: Arms and Fury (Icy Veins)
[1961] = "武器與狂怒（Icy Veins）",
-- f6c638d4 English: Melee Arms and Fury from level 1 to 60, and the default for any warrior outside
--     Defensive Stance. Forever rage is scarce and hidden from addons, so it pools by spending on
--     anything else only while Mortal Strike or Bloodthirst is recovering: Charge to pull, Victory
--     Rush, Intercept, Execute (in its range) on elites, bosses or in a group, Whirlwind or Thunder
--     Clap, Demoralizing Shout and Slam on packs, Spearing Strike on Giants and Dragonkin, Rend
--     until Bloodthirst, Overpower, Mortal Strike, Bloodthirst, then Whirlwind, Slam while standing
--     and two Sunder Armors (five on elites). Reminders: Battle Shout, Bloodrage, the interrupt,
--     Heroic Strike while the main strike recovers, Cleave on packs, Sweeping Strikes, Death Wish
--     and Berserker Rage; Recklessness and Retaliation are listed but off. Left to you: stance
--     dancing, Hamstring and consumables.
[1962] = "武器與狂怒近戰，適用於 1 至 60 級，也是所有不在防禦姿態的戰士的預設循環。永久版本中怒氣稀少且對插件隱藏，因此只在致死打擊或嗜血恢復期間才把怒氣花在其他技能上，藉此累積怒氣：以衝鋒拉怪、勝利衝擊、攔截，斬殺（在其範圍內）用於精英、首領或隊伍中，旋風斬或雷霆一擊，怪群時挫志怒吼與猛擊，對巨人與龍類使用穿刺打擊，學會嗜血前使用撕裂、壓制、致死打擊、嗜血，然後旋風斬，站著不動時猛擊，兩層破甲攻擊（對精英疊五層）。提醒：戰鬥怒吼、血性狂暴、中斷施法、主要攻擊恢復期間的英勇打擊、怪群時的順劈斬、橫掃攻擊、死亡之願與狂暴之怒；魯莽與反擊風暴已列出但預設關閉。由你自行處理：姿態切換、斷筋與消耗品。",
-- c9c030cd English: Arms and Fury, spend rage (Warcraft Tavern)
[1963] = "武器與狂怒，傾瀉怒氣（Warcraft Tavern）",
-- 469a4f88 English: Warcraft Tavern's always-spend list for groups and raids: five Sunder Armors
--     first, Execute above everything below 20%, Overpower, Rend until Bloodthirst, Mortal Strike,
--     Bloodthirst, Whirlwind, Spearing Strike on cooldown, Slam once Improved Slam is taken; Heroic
--     Strike or Cleave whenever you can afford them (rage is hidden on Forever, so there is no
--     60-rage threshold or spare-rage Hamstring), Recklessness on cooldown with Death Wish beside
--     it. Choose it instead of the Icy Veins premade if you play in groups and do not need to save
--     rage between pulls. An alternative to the recommended melee DPS premade, off by default:
--     enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority.
[1964] = "Warcraft Tavern 用於隊伍與團隊的持續傾瀉怒氣清單：先疊五層破甲攻擊，目標低於 20% 時斬殺優先於一切，壓制，學會嗜血前使用撕裂，致死打擊、嗜血、旋風斬，穿刺打擊冷卻結束即使用，點了強化猛擊後使用猛擊；只要負擔得起就使用英勇打擊或順劈斬（永久版本中怒氣是隱藏的，因此沒有 60 怒氣門檻，也沒有怒氣有餘時的斷筋），魯莽冷卻結束即使用並同時使用死亡之願。如果你在隊伍中遊戲，不需要在兩次拉怪之間保留怒氣，請選擇它而非 Icy Veins 內建循環。這是推薦的近戰傷害輸出內建循環的替代選項，預設為停用：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。",
-- d05e07b7 English: Balance
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Druid, WoW
--     Forever (variant key: Balance).
[1965] = "平衡",
-- fdac9d3d English: Balance from level 1 to 60, and the default for any Forever Druid no other
--     premade fits (levels 1–9, untalented casters, solo Restoration). Pulls with Wrath; while
--     moving, refreshes Moonfire, Insect Swarm and, in a group, Faerie Fire. Hurricane when three
--     or more enemies are fighting you, then your own Moonfire and Insect Swarm, Starfire while
--     Eclipse charges or Clearcasting are up, and Wrath; when you cannot afford Wrath it lets you
--     melee. Health and mana are hidden from addons on Forever, so healing yourself and judging
--     whether a target is worth a DoT are your call. Reminders: Mark of the Wild, Thorns while
--     solo, Moonkin Form, a pre-pull Rejuvenation while solo, Nature's Grasp when a mob is on you,
--     Innervate whenever it is ready in combat while solo. Form changes, crowd control, Barkskin
--     and target choice stay with you. Built from level-30 beta guides; level 31–60 steps follow
--     the class design and are untested.
[1966] = "平衡，適用於 1 至 60 級，也是沒有其他內建循環適用時所有永久德魯伊的預設循環（1–9 級、未點天賦的施法者、單人的恢復德魯伊）。以憤怒拉怪；移動時刷新月火術、蟲群，隊伍中還有精靈之火。三個以上敵人與你交戰時使用颶風，接著是你自己的月火術與蟲群，蝕星蔽月充能或節能施法期間使用星火術，以及憤怒；無法負擔憤怒時讓你進行近戰。在永久版本中，插件看不到生命力與法力，因此治療自己，以及判斷目標是否值得上持續傷害效果，都由你決定。提醒：野性印記、單人時的荊棘術、梟獸形態、單人時拉怪前的回春術、怪物貼身時的自然之握、單人時戰鬥中只要啟動就緒就使用。形態切換、控場、樹皮術與目標選擇由你自行處理。依據 30 級測試版指南製作；31–60 級的步驟依循職業設計，尚未經過測試。",
-- 78805a61 English: Balance, Multi-DoT (Warcraft Tavern)
[1967] = "平衡，多目標持續傷害（Warcraft Tavern）",
-- 3841b7e5 English: Warcraft Tavern's Multi-DoT leveling style, an alternative to the recommended
--     Balance premade, off by default: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. Pulls
--     with Wrath, keeps your Moonfire and Insect Swarm on the target, roots it with Entangling
--     Roots once both are running while another enemy is fighting you, then Wrath. No Starfire (the
--     build skips Eclipse). Switching to the next enemy is up to you. Reminders: Mark of the Wild,
--     Thorns while solo.
[1968] = "Warcraft Tavern 的多目標持續傷害升級打法，作為推薦的平衡內建循環的替代，預設為停用：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。以憤怒拉怪，維持目標身上你自己的月火術與蟲群，兩者都生效且另有敵人與你交戰時以糾纏根鬚定住它，然後是憤怒。不使用星火術（此流派不點蝕星蔽月）。切換到下一個敵人由你決定。提醒：野性印記、單人時的荊棘術。",
-- 78daf4ac English: Feral, Cat and Bear
[1969] = "野性，獵豹與熊",
-- 420ae9f2 English: Cat and Bear in one premade, chosen by your form; it takes over once Feral is
--     your main talent tree (or has 11 points), or when you shift into Cat or Bear Form. Cat:
--     Ravage or Shred from Prowl, Faerie Fire, Rip at four combo points, Ferocious Bite once Rip
--     runs, Rake, then Shred when the target is not facing you (Claw otherwise). Bear: Faerie Fire
--     and Feral Charge at range, Demoralizing Roar in a group or on two enemies, Primal Bite, Swipe
--     on three or more, Lacerate, Swipe. In caster form it suggests Cat Form (Bear before you have
--     Cat). Reminders: Maul whenever you can afford it in Bear Form, Enrage, Berserk on big pulls
--     or elites, Innervate while solo, Mark of the Wild, Thorns. Health, energy, rage and mana are
--     hidden from addons on Forever, so powershifting, Frenzied Regeneration and healing yourself
--     are your call. Taunts, interrupts and positioning stay with you.
[1970] = "獵豹與熊合併為一個內建循環，依你的形態選擇；一旦野性成為你的主要天賦樹（或已投入 11 點），或你變為獵豹或熊形態，就由它接手。獵豹：潛伏狀態下使用毀滅或撕碎、精靈之火、四個連擊點時使用撕扯、撕扯生效後使用兇猛撕咬、掃擊，然後在目標未面向你時使用撕碎（否則使用爪擊）。熊：遠距離使用精靈之火與野性衝鋒，隊伍中或面對兩個敵人時使用挫志咆哮、原始撕咬，三個以上敵人時使用揮擊、割裂、揮擊。人形態下會建議獵豹形態（學會獵豹前為熊形態）。提醒：熊形態下只要負擔得起就使用槌擊、狂怒、大規模拉怪或面對精英時的狂暴、單人時的啟動、野性印記、荊棘術。在永久版本中，插件看不到生命力、能量、怒氣與法力，因此能量變形、狂暴回復與治療自己都由你決定。嘲諷、中斷施法與站位由你自行處理。",
-- 6a3c6c77 English: Restoration
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Druid, WoW
--     Forever (variant key: Restoration).
[1971] = "恢復",
-- 2bcf6375 English: Group healing after Warcraft Tavern, once Restoration is your main talent tree
--     with 11 points. Heals your current friendly target: Swiftmend on a target with your HoT, Wild
--     Growth, Regrowth and Rejuvenation when missing, Healing Touch. Health and mana are hidden
--     from addons on Forever, so the target you pick is the only sign of who needs healing. On a
--     hostile target: Moonfire, Insect Swarm, Wrath. Reminders: Innervate in combat, Nature's
--     Swiftness on a friendly target in combat, Remove Curse and Abolish Poison, Mark of the Wild;
--     Tranquility is yours. You pick who to heal and the spell rank; solo Restoration uses the
--     Balance premade.
[1972] = "依據 Warcraft Tavern 的隊伍治療，當恢復是你的主要天賦樹且已投入 11 點後生效。治療你目前的友方目標：對帶有你的持續治療效果的目標使用迅癒，野性痊癒，缺少時使用癒合與回春術，治療之觸。在永久版本中，插件看不到生命力與法力，因此你選取的目標是判斷誰需要治療的唯一依據。目標為敵對時：月火術、蟲群、憤怒。提醒：戰鬥中的啟動、戰鬥中對友方目標使用自然迅捷、解除詛咒與驅毒術、野性印記；寧靜由你自行處理。要治療誰與法術等級由你決定；單人的恢復德魯伊使用平衡內建循環。",
-- e898fb57 English: Restoration, HoTs first (Icy Veins)
[1973] = "恢復，持續治療優先（Icy Veins）",
-- 62addd5b English: Icy Veins' HoT-first healing, an alternative to the recommended Restoration
--     premade, off by default: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. On your
--     friendly target: Rejuvenation, then Regrowth when missing, Healing Touch only with both HoTs
--     running, Swiftmend on a HoT target, then Wild Growth (health is hidden on Forever, so the
--     target you pick decides who is healed). Innervate on cooldown. Otherwise the same reminders
--     and hostile-target list as the Restoration premade.
[1974] = "Icy Veins 的持續治療優先治療法，作為推薦的恢復內建循環的替代，預設為停用：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。對你的友方目標：回春術，缺少時使用癒合，只在兩種持續治療效果都生效時使用治療之觸，對有持續治療效果的目標使用迅癒，然後是野性痊癒（在永久版本中生命力是隱藏的，因此你選取的目標決定誰獲得治療）。啟動冷卻結束即使用。其餘提醒與敵對目標清單與恢復內建循環相同。",
-- 8335d07b English: Ranged (Wowhead)
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Hunter,
--     WoW Forever (variant key: Ranged). Names in parentheses (guide or tool such as Icy Veins,
--     Wowhead, SimulationCraft, wowsims, Hekili, Mobalytics, Warcraft Tavern) are proper names and
--     stay unchanged.
[1975] = "遠程（Wowhead）",
-- 5c5cdd9b English: Every ranged Hunter from level 1 to 60 (Beast Mastery, Marksmanship, and
--     Survival until Strider Kick), and the Forever Hunter default. Pull: Hunter's Mark, Sniper
--     Shot while Rapid Killing lasts, Auto Shot. Then your own Serpent Sting, Summon Hawk twice and
--     Arcane Shot once on their shared cooldown (Arcane Shot on cooldown before Summon Hawk),
--     Sniper Shot under Rapid Killing or on elites, Aimed Shot. Two or more enemies fighting you:
--     Multi-Shot instead of Aimed Shot, Explosive Trap with three near you, Volley on five. Moving:
--     instant shots only. A mob in melee range gets Raptor Strike and Mongoose Bite. Reminders:
--     Aspect of the Hawk (Monkey before it), Trueshot Aura, pet calling and reviving, Rapid Fire,
--     Bestial Wrath and Blood Fury on elites or in dungeons, Intimidation when a mob is on you. Pet
--     commands, feeding, kiting and Feign Death stay with you; disable the pet reminders if you
--     play Lone Wolf. It never reads your mana or anyone's health, which Forever hides from addons,
--     so Hunter's Mark and Serpent Sting go on every target and Mend Pet is yours.
[1976] = "適用於 1 至 60 級的所有遠程獵人（野獸控制、射擊，以及學會陸行鳥腳踢之前的生存），也是永久獵人的預設循環。拉怪：獵人印記、急速殺戮持續期間使用狙擊射擊、自動射擊。接著是你自己的毒蛇釘刺，在共用冷卻中兩次召喚獵鷹與一次秘法射擊（學會召喚獵鷹之前秘法射擊冷卻結束即使用），急速殺戮期間或對精英使用狙擊射擊、瞄準射擊。兩個以上敵人與你交戰時：以多重射擊取代瞄準射擊，附近有三個敵人時使用爆炸陷阱，五個時使用亂射。移動時：只使用瞬發射擊。近戰範圍內的怪物會吃到猛禽一擊與貓鼬撕咬。提醒：雄鷹守護（學會前為靈猴守護）、強擊光環、召喚與復活寵物、急速射擊、對精英或在地城中使用狂野怒火與血性狂暴、怪物貼身時使用脅迫。寵物指令、餵食、放風箏與假死由你自行處理；如果你使用孤狼，請停用寵物提醒。它從不讀取你的法力或任何人的生命力（永久版本會對插件隱藏這些資料），因此獵人印記與毒蛇釘刺會施放在每個目標上，治療寵物由你自行處理。",
-- a82fce4f English: Ranged, mana-saving (Mobalytics)
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Hunter,
--     WoW Forever (variant key: RangedMobalytics). Names in parentheses (guide or tool such as Icy
--     Veins, Wowhead, SimulationCraft, wowsims, Hekili, Mobalytics, Warcraft Tavern) are proper
--     names and stay unchanged.
[1977] = "遠程，節省法力（Mobalytics）",
-- 530b5b4d English: Mobalytics' mana-saving leveling style, an alternative to the recommended
--     Wowhead ranged premade, off by default: enable it and disable that one, or raise its
--     priority. Keeps your Serpent Sting up, one Summon Hawk out, Aimed Shot (Multi-Shot on two or
--     more enemies), and never Arcane Shot once Summon Hawk is known; its second Hawk on a healthy
--     target is left out, as Forever hides target health. Same pull, melee, movement and reminders
--     as the Wowhead premade.
[1978] = "Mobalytics 的節省法力升級打法，作為推薦的 Wowhead 遠程內建循環的替代，預設為停用：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。維持你自己的毒蛇釘刺，維持一隻召喚出的獵鷹，瞄準射擊（兩個以上敵人時用多重射擊），學會召喚獵鷹後不再使用秘法射擊；由於永久版本會隱藏目標生命力，因此不會對血量充足的目標召喚第二隻獵鷹。拉怪、近戰、移動與提醒都與 Wowhead 內建循環相同。",
-- 5f8e7ecc English: Survival melee (Wowhead)
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Hunter,
--     WoW Forever (variant key: Survival). Names in parentheses (guide or tool such as Icy Veins,
--     Wowhead, SimulationCraft, wowsims, Hekili, Mobalytics, Warcraft Tavern) are proper names and
--     stay unchanged.
[1979] = "生存近戰（Wowhead）",
-- 8da10e55 English: Dual-wield melee Survival once Survival is your main talent tree with 21
--     points, Strider Kick's tier (until then the ranged premade levels you, as the guides advise).
--     Pull with Hunter's Mark and Serpent Sting, then Mongoose Bite, Strider Kick, Raptor Strike
--     and Counterattack, with Explosive Trap on three or more enemies. Out of melee it shoots:
--     Serpent Sting, Arcane Shot, Aimed Shot, Auto Shot. Reminders: Aspect of the Beast, Hunter's
--     Mark (Expose Prey needs it), Rapid Fire and Blood Fury on elites or in dungeons, Deterrence
--     while you hold the target's attention, pet care (health is hidden on Forever, so Mend Pet is
--     yours). An optional Immolation Trap step is off by default.
[1980] = "當生存是你的主要天賦樹且已投入 21 點（陸行鳥腳踢所在層）後的雙持近戰生存（在此之前依指南建議由遠程內建循環帶你升級）。以獵人印記與毒蛇釘刺拉怪，接著是貓鼬撕咬、陸行鳥腳踢、猛禽一擊與反擊，三個以上敵人時使用爆炸陷阱。不在近戰範圍時進行射擊：毒蛇釘刺、秘法射擊、瞄準射擊、自動射擊。提醒：野獸守護、獵人印記（暴露獵物需要它）、對精英或在地城中使用急速射擊與血性狂暴、你持有目標注意力時使用威懾、寵物照料（永久版本中生命力是隱藏的，因此治療寵物由你自行處理）。選擇性的獻祭陷阱步驟預設關閉。",
-- 5f76137b English: Survival two-hand weave (Wowhead)
[1981] = "生存雙手穿插（Wowhead）",
-- bce9f264 English: Wowhead's in-and-out weave for a two-handed Survival Hunter, an alternative to
--     the recommended Survival melee premade, off by default: enable it and disable that one, or
--     raise its priority. In melee: Mongoose Bite and Raptor Strike; when Raptor Strike is more
--     than 2.5 seconds away, Strider Kick and step out. Out of melee: Serpent Sting, Arcane Shot,
--     Aimed Shot and Auto Shot until Raptor Strike is nearly ready, then back in. You do the
--     moving; RM follows your range.
[1982] = "Wowhead 針對雙手武器生存獵人的進出穿插打法，作為推薦的生存近戰內建循環的替代，預設為停用：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。近戰時：貓鼬撕咬與猛禽一擊；當猛禽一擊還需 2.5 秒以上才就緒時，使用陸行鳥腳踢並退出近戰。不在近戰時：毒蛇釘刺、秘法射擊、瞄準射擊與自動射擊，直到猛禽一擊即將就緒，然後回到近戰。移動由你負責；RM 會依你的距離調整。",
-- 17636dd6 English: Frost
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Mage, WoW
--     Forever (variant key: Frost).
[1983] = "冰霜",
-- 115d3d5e English: Frost from level 1 to 60, and the Forever Mage default before talent spells
--     (Fireball until Frostbolt at level 4). Pulls with Frostbolt; then Ice Lance on Fingers of
--     Frost or a frozen target (also while Frostbolt is still casting, to cancel or batch), Cone of
--     Cold at five Winter's Chill stacks, Arcane Missiles on Missile Barrage, Frostbolt, and a wand
--     when solo and you cannot afford Frostbolt. Moving: Ice Lance, else Fire Blast. Three or more
--     enemies fighting you: Cone of Cold; five or more: Blizzard, or Arcane Explosion with a mob on
--     you. Warcraft Tavern's Flamestrike and Arcane Explosion AoE is included but off. Reminders:
--     Arcane Intellect, armor (Ice or Frost solo, Mage Armor in a group, never replacing one you
--     chose), Ice Barrier, Counterspell, Remove Lesser Curse, Frost Nova when a mob reaches you,
--     Cold Snap. Health and mana are hidden from addons on Forever, so finishing low targets with
--     Fire Blast, Evocation and Ice Block are your call; Blink, kiting, Polymorph and mana gems
--     stay with you too.
[1984] = "冰霜，適用於 1 至 60 級，也是永久法師在學會天賦法術前的預設循環（4 級學會寒冰箭之前為火球術）。以寒冰箭拉怪；接著在冰霜之指觸發或目標被冰凍時使用冰霜長矛（寒冰箭仍在施放時也可使用，以取消或合併施法），深冬之寒疊滿五層時使用冰錐術，飛彈彈幕觸發時使用秘法飛彈，然後是寒冰箭，單人且無法負擔寒冰箭時使用魔杖。移動時：冰霜長矛，否則火焰衝擊。三個以上敵人與你交戰時：冰錐術；五個以上時：暴風雪，或在有怪物貼身時使用魔爆術。包含 Warcraft Tavern 的烈焰風暴與魔爆術範圍傷害打法，但預設關閉。提醒：秘法智慧、護甲（單人用冰甲術或霜甲術，隊伍中用魔甲術，絕不取代你已選擇的護甲）、寒冰護體、法術反制、解除次級詛咒、怪物貼身時的冰霜新星、急速冷卻。在永久版本中，插件看不到生命力與法力，因此用火焰衝擊收掉低血量目標、喚醒與寒冰屏障都由你決定；閃現術、放風箏、變形術與法力寶石也由你自行處理。",
-- c141faa8 English: Fire
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Mage, WoW
--     Forever (variant key: Fire).
[1985] = "火焰",
-- 0f5f59f3 English: Fire once Fire is your main talent tree with 11 points (Pyroblast's tier).
--     Pulls with Pyroblast on elites, else Frostfire Bolt or Fireball; then Pyroblast at three
--     Heating Up stacks, Ice Lance on Fingers of Frost or a frozen target (Fire/Frost hybrids),
--     Fire Blast on cooldown, Scorch to keep your five Fire Vulnerability stacks on elites,
--     Frostfire Bolt (from 40) or Fireball, wand when solo and you cannot afford a spell. Moving:
--     Fire Blast or Ice Lance. Four or more enemies fighting you: Flamestrike, Blast Wave, Arcane
--     Explosion. Scorch starts the stacks only once you have Improved Scorch; a close-range Scorch
--     is off until you enable it. Reminders: Combustion and Presence of Mind on elites, plus the
--     Mage upkeep reminders.
[1986] = "當火焰是你的主要天賦樹且已投入 11 點（炎爆術所在層）後的火焰。對精英以炎爆術拉怪，否則用霜火箭或火球術；接著在升溫疊滿三層時使用炎爆術，冰霜之指觸發或目標被冰凍時使用冰霜長矛（火焰/冰霜混合流派），火焰衝擊冷卻結束即使用，對精英使用灼燒維持五層火焰易傷，霜火箭（40 級起）或火球術，單人且無法負擔法術時使用魔杖。移動時：火焰衝擊或冰霜長矛。四個以上敵人與你交戰時：烈焰風暴、衝擊波、魔爆術。灼燒只有在你擁有強化灼燒時才會開始疊層；近距離灼燒在你啟用之前維持關閉。提醒：對精英使用燃燒與氣定神閒，以及法師的常規維持提醒。",
-- 62e66205 English: Fire leveling (Icy Veins)
[1987] = "火焰升級（Icy Veins）",
-- 34690108 English: Icy Veins' Fire leveling build without Improved Scorch, an alternative to the
--     recommended Fire premade, off by default: enable it and disable that one, or raise its
--     priority. Pulls with Pyroblast, uses Fire Blast to spend Wake of Fire, Scorch as the mob
--     closes (target health is hidden on Forever, so its low-target finishers are yours), then
--     Frostfire Bolt (from 40) or Fireball. Same AoE, movement, wand and reminders as the Fire
--     premade, without Combustion and Presence of Mind.
[1988] = "Icy Veins 不點強化灼燒的火焰升級天賦配置，作為推薦的火焰內建循環的替代，預設為停用：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。以炎爆術拉怪，以火焰衝擊消耗火焰甦醒，怪物靠近時使用灼燒（永久版本會隱藏目標生命力，因此收掉低血量目標由你自行處理），然後是霜火箭（40 級起）或火球術。範圍傷害、移動、魔杖與提醒都與火焰內建循環相同，但不含燃燒與氣定神閒。",
-- 93006d61 English: Arcane
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Mage, WoW
--     Forever (variant key: Arcane).
[1989] = "秘法",
-- c17e7c93 English: Arcane once Arcane is your main talent tree with 11 points and you know Arcane
--     Blast. Pulls with Frostbolt solo or Arcane Blast in a group; then Arcane Missiles on Missile
--     Barrage, Arcane Blast on Clearcasting, Arcane Wrath at three Arcane Blast stacks, Arcane
--     Blast up to four stacks on elites and two on other targets while you can afford it (mana is
--     hidden on Forever), then Frostfire Bolt, Frostbolt or Fireball to fish for Missile Barrage,
--     and a wand when solo and you cannot afford a spell. Without Arcane Wrath (the older beta
--     design) Fire Blast spends the stacks. Moving: Fire Blast. Three or more enemies fighting you:
--     Arcane Explosion. Reminders: Presence of Mind and Arcane Power on elites (Arcane Power no
--     longer waits for half your mana), plus the Mage upkeep reminders.
[1990] = "當秘法是你的主要天賦樹且已投入 11 點，並學會秘法衝擊後的秘法。單人時以寒冰箭拉怪，隊伍中以秘法衝擊拉怪；接著飛彈彈幕觸發時使用秘法飛彈，節能施法時使用秘法衝擊，秘法衝擊疊滿三層時使用秘法懲戒，在負擔得起時（永久版本會隱藏法力）對精英疊加秘法衝擊至四層、對其他目標疊加至兩層，然後以霜火箭、寒冰箭或火球術來觸發飛彈彈幕，單人且無法負擔法術時使用魔杖。沒有秘法懲戒時（較早的測試版設計）由火焰衝擊消耗層數。移動時：火焰衝擊。三個以上敵人與你交戰時：魔爆術。提醒：對精英使用氣定神閒與秘法強化（秘法強化不再等到法力剩一半），以及法師的常規維持提醒。",
-- 1d79fa22 English: Retribution
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Paladin,
--     WoW Forever (variant key: Retribution).
[1991] = "懲戒",
-- 4d5c0907 English: Retribution and every melee Paladin from level 1 to 60, and the Forever Paladin
--     default. Keeps a damage seal up, refreshed only when it runs low: Seal of the Crusader judged
--     once on an elite target, then Seal of Command with a slow (3.0 s) weapon, else Seal of
--     Righteousness. Then Holy Strike on cooldown, Holy Shock and Light's Vigil for a Shockadin,
--     Exorcism on Undead and Demons, Consecration on three or more enemies, Hammer of Wrath when it
--     can be cast, and melee. Judgement is off the global cooldown, so it is a reminder whenever a
--     seal is up. Other reminders: your aura and Blessing (Retribution Aura and Kings once learned;
--     yours are kept). Optional step, off by default: Hammer of Justice before a Seal of Command
--     Judgement. Mana, health and the swing timer are hidden from addons on Forever, so mana
--     saving, healing yourself, Lay on Hands and Twist of Light seal swapping are your call. Built
--     from level-30 beta guides.
[1992] = "適用於 1 至 60 級的懲戒及所有近戰聖騎士，也是永久聖騎士的預設循環。維持一個傷害聖印，只在即將消失時刷新：對精英目標審判一次十字軍聖印，接著使用慢速（3.0 秒）武器時用命令聖印，否則用正義聖印。然後神聖打擊冷卻結束即使用，震擊騎（Shockadin）使用神聖震擊與聖光戒備，對不死族與惡魔使用驅邪術，三個以上敵人時使用奉獻，可施放時使用憤怒之錘，以及近戰。審判不受共用冷卻影響，因此只要有聖印，它就會以提醒出現。其他提醒：你的光環與祝福（學會後為懲戒光環與王者祝福；會保留你自己選擇的）。預設關閉的選擇性步驟：命令聖印審判前使用制裁之錘。在永久版本中，插件看不到法力、生命力與揮擊計時，因此節省法力、治療自己、聖療術與聖光折射聖印切換都由你決定。依據 30 級測試版指南製作。",
-- 2ba64aad English: Protection (Wowhead)
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Paladin,
--     WoW Forever (variant key: Protection). Names in parentheses (guide or tool such as Icy Veins,
--     Wowhead, SimulationCraft, wowsims, Hekili, Mobalytics, Warcraft Tavern) are proper names and
--     stay unchanged.
[1993] = "防護（Wowhead）",
-- 65aad40e English: Tanking, once Protection is your main talent tree or you turn on Righteous
--     Fury. When the target is fighting someone else: Judgement with Seal of Fury (the taunt),
--     Swift Judgement to reset it. Two or more enemies engaged: Consecration, Exorcism and Holy
--     Wrath on Undead and Demons, Holy Strike. One enemy: Exorcism on Undead and Demons, Holy
--     Strike, Consecration. Reminders: Righteous Fury, Seal of Fury, Judgement on cooldown, Holy
--     Shield while tanking, your aura and Blessing. Health and mana are hidden from addons on
--     Forever, so Templar's Bulwark and Lay on Hands are your call. Pulling, positioning and other
--     taunts stay with you.
[1994] = "當防護是你的主要天賦樹，或你開啟正義之怒後的坦克循環。目標正在攻擊其他人時：搭配憤怒聖印使用審判（嘲諷），以迅捷審判重置它。與兩個以上敵人交戰時：奉獻、對不死族與惡魔使用驅邪術與神聖憤怒、神聖打擊。單一敵人時：對不死族與惡魔使用驅邪術、神聖打擊、奉獻。提醒：正義之怒、憤怒聖印、審判冷卻結束即使用、坦克時的神聖之盾、你的光環與祝福。在永久版本中，插件看不到生命力與法力，因此聖殿騎士之壁壘與聖療術由你決定。拉怪、站位與其他嘲諷由你自行處理。",
-- 6bae5e51 English: Protection, Consecration first (Icy Veins)
[1995] = "防護，奉獻優先（Icy Veins）",
-- 7d470fde English: Icy Veins' tanking style, an alternative to the recommended Wowhead Protection
--     premade, off by default: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. Consecration
--     first whenever you can afford it, on one enemy too; Judgement is kept for taunts (no
--     on-cooldown reminder), with Swift Judgement to reset it; then Holy Strike and Exorcism on
--     Undead and Demons. Same tank reminders otherwise.
[1996] = "Icy Veins 的坦克打法，作為推薦的 Wowhead 防護內建循環的替代，預設為停用：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。只要負擔得起就優先奉獻，單一敵人時也一樣；審判留作嘲諷使用（沒有冷卻結束即使用的提醒），以迅捷審判重置它；然後是神聖打擊，對不死族與惡魔使用驅邪術。其餘坦克提醒相同。",
-- 56eee6a5 English: Holy
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Paladin,
--     WoW Forever (variant key: Holy).
[1997] = "神聖",
-- 23d8ec27 English: Group healing once Holy is your main talent tree with 21 points (Holy Shock's
--     tier), while Righteous Fury is off (a grouped Shockadin lands here too). Heals your current
--     friendly target: Holy Shock on a target with your Light's Vigil, Light's Vigil in combat,
--     Cleanse or Purify, Holy Shock while moving, Holy Light with Infusion of Light, Flash of Light
--     as the main heal. On an enemy: Judgement of Light when Seal of Light is up, Holy Shock,
--     Light's Vigil, Holy Strike, Exorcism. Reminders: Seal of Light when you have no seal, Divine
--     Favor in combat on a friendly target, your aura and Blessing. Health and mana are hidden from
--     addons on Forever, so the target you pick is the only sign of who needs healing; emergency
--     Holy Shocks, big Holy Lights and Lay on Hands are your call.
[1998] = "當神聖是你的主要天賦樹且已投入 21 點（神聖震擊所在層）、正義之怒未開啟時的隊伍治療（隊伍中的震擊騎也會使用這裡）。治療你目前的友方目標：對帶有你的聖光戒備的目標使用神聖震擊，戰鬥中使用聖光戒備，清潔術或純淨術，移動時使用神聖震擊，聖光灌注時使用聖光術，聖光閃現作為主要治療。目標為敵人時：有光明聖印時使用聖光審判，神聖震擊、聖光戒備、神聖打擊、驅邪術。提醒：沒有聖印時使用光明聖印、戰鬥中對友方目標使用神恩術、你的光環與祝福。在永久版本中，插件看不到生命力與法力，因此你選取的目標是判斷誰需要治療的唯一依據；緊急神聖震擊、大量聖光術與聖療術由你決定。",
-- b959207f English: Holy, Holy Shock on cooldown (Wowhead)
[1999] = "神聖，神聖震擊冷卻結束即使用（Wowhead）",
-- f6c7691e English: Wowhead's healing style, an alternative to the recommended Holy premade, off by
--     default: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. Holy Shock as a routine heal
--     on cooldown, dispels, Flash of Light (health is hidden on Forever, so Holy Light for big
--     deficits is your call). On an enemy it keeps your Judgement of Light up by swapping to Seal
--     of Light, judging and swapping back to Seal of Righteousness, then Holy Strike, Exorcism on
--     Undead and Demons, Holy Shock and Consecration. Same reminders as the Holy premade.
[2000] = "Wowhead 的治療打法，作為推薦的神聖內建循環的替代，預設為停用：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。神聖震擊作為常規治療冷卻結束即使用、驅散、聖光閃現（永久版本會隱藏生命力，因此損失較多時使用聖光術由你決定）。目標為敵人時，它會透過切換到光明聖印、審判，再切換回正義聖印來維持你的聖光審判，然後是神聖打擊、對不死族與惡魔使用驅邪術、神聖震擊與奉獻。提醒與神聖內建循環相同。",
-- e64b45e0 English: Shadow and solo damage
[2001] = "暗影與單人傷害",
-- 4394336c English: Shadow, and every Priest's solo play, from level 1 to 60; the Forever Priest
--     default. Pulls with Power Word: Shield (solo) and Mind Blast (Holy Fire for Holy and
--     Discipline, Smite before Mind Blast). Then Shadowform once learned, your own Shadow Word:
--     Pain and Devouring Plague, Mind Blast, Holy Fire into Penance for Discipline, Mind Flay in
--     Shadowform; solo before Shadowform, Holy Nova on three enemies with Holy Purpose, then the
--     wand (Smite without one). Moving: Pain, Plague. Reminders: Inner Fire, Fortitude, Divine
--     Spirit, racial buffs, Vampiric Embrace, Inner Focus, Silence, Elune's Light; Psychic Scream
--     is off by default. Health and mana are hidden from addons on Forever, so executing with
--     Shadow Word: Death, healing yourself and Dark Sacrifice are your call. Built from level-30
--     beta guides; Shadowform play follows Mobalytics.
[2002] = "適用於 1 至 60 級的暗影以及所有牧師的單人打法；永久牧師的預設循環。以真言術:盾（單人）與心靈震爆拉怪（神聖與戒律用神聖之火，學會心靈震爆前用懲擊）。接著學會後使用暗影形態，你自己的暗言術:痛與噬靈瘟疫，心靈震爆，戒律以神聖之火接懺悟，暗影形態下使用精神鞭笞；學會暗影形態前單人時，神聖意圖觸發且有三個敵人時使用神聖新星，然後是魔杖（沒有魔杖時用懲擊）。移動時：痛、瘟疫。提醒：心靈之火、真言術:韌、神聖之靈、種族增益、吸血鬼的擁抱、心靈專注、沉默、伊露恩之光；心靈尖嘯預設關閉。在永久版本中，插件看不到生命力與法力，因此用暗言術:死斬殺、治療自己與黑暗獻祭由你決定。依據 30 級測試版指南製作；暗影形態打法依循 Mobalytics。",
-- 05426e5b English: DoT and wand leveling (Mobalytics)
[2003] = "持續傷害與魔杖升級（Mobalytics）",
-- df96ccf0 English: Mobalytics' leveling style, an alternative to the recommended Shadow premade,
--     off by default: enable it and disable that one, or raise its priority. Mind Blast and Holy
--     Fire only on tough mobs (elites, or two levels above you), your own Shadow Word: Pain and
--     Devouring Plague, then the wand (Smite without one). From Shadowform: Mind Blast, Pain,
--     Plague, Mind Flay. Shield and Renew on yourself between pulls, Cure Disease on yourself.
--     Health and mana are hidden from addons on Forever, so healing yourself is your call.
--     Spreading Pain across several mobs is up to you.
[2004] = "Mobalytics 的升級打法，作為推薦的暗影內建循環的替代，預設為停用：啟用它並停用那個，或提高它的優先順序。心靈震爆與神聖之火只用於難纏的怪物（精英，或比你高兩級），你自己的暗言術:痛與噬靈瘟疫，然後是魔杖（沒有魔杖時用懲擊）。學會暗影形態後：心靈震爆、痛、瘟疫、精神鞭笞。兩次拉怪之間對自己使用真言術:盾與恢復，對自己使用祛病術。在永久版本中，插件看不到生命力與法力，因此治療自己由你決定。在多隻怪物之間擴散痛由你決定。",
-- ef4ae5d0 English: Discipline and Holy healing
[2005] = "戒律與神聖治療",
-- 787c3a6e English: Group healing once Discipline or Holy is your main talent tree and you do not
--     know Shadowform. Heals your current friendly target: before the pull Power Word: Shield,
--     Prayer of Mending and Renew; Dispel Magic and Abolish or Cure Disease; Prayer of Mending;
--     Holy Nova on Holy Purpose; Penance; Renew when missing; Heal (Lesser Heal before it). On an
--     enemy: Shadow Word: Pain, Holy Fire, Penance, Smite, wand. Reminders: Inner Fire, Fortitude,
--     Divine Spirit, Power Infusion on another player, Inner Focus in combat and the racial spells.
--     Health and mana are hidden from addons on Forever, so the target you pick is the only sign of
--     who needs healing; emergency heals, Prayer of Healing, Binding Heal, Greater and Flash Heal,
--     Desperate Prayer and Dark Sacrifice are your call. You pick who to heal and the rank; a
--     Discipline healer before Penance (20–29) selects it by hand.
[2006] = "當戒律或神聖是你的主要天賦樹，且未學會暗影形態後的隊伍治療。治療你目前的友方目標：拉怪前使用真言術:盾、癒合禱言與恢復；驅散魔法以及驅除疾病或祛病術；癒合禱言；神聖意圖觸發時使用神聖新星；懺悟；缺少時使用恢復；治療術（在此之前為次級治療術）。目標為敵人時：暗言術:痛、神聖之火、懺悟、懲擊、魔杖。提醒：心靈之火、真言術:韌、神聖之靈、對其他玩家使用注入能量、戰鬥中的心靈專注與種族法術。在永久版本中，插件看不到生命力與法力，因此你選取的目標是判斷誰需要治療的唯一依據；緊急治療、治療禱言、束縛治療、強效治療術與快速治療、絕望禱言與黑暗獻祭由你決定。要治療誰與法術等級由你決定；學會懺悟前的戒律治療者（20–29 級）需要手動選擇它。",
-- 00b5eb13 English: Blizzard Assisted
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Death
--     Knight, Retail (current expansion) (variant key: Blood). This one follows Blizzard's Assisted
--     Combat suggestion.
[2007] = "暴雪戰鬥助手",
-- d2ca4d91 English: Recommended for Blood. Highlights the spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests
--     next, the one rotation advice the game still lets an addon read in Midnight combat; it waits
--     while you cast or channel. Alongside it, reminders for what Assisted Combat leaves to you:
--     Vampiric Blood and Raise Dead in combat, Mind Freeze on an interruptible cast, and Icebound
--     Fortitude and your racial cooldown whenever they are ready in combat. Enemy casts are hidden
--     in combat, so Mind Freeze lights only where the game shows them; health is hidden on Retail,
--     so when to use Icebound Fortitude is your call. Active mitigation timing, Anti-Magic Shell,
--     taunts and trinkets stay with you.
[2008] = "推薦血魄專精使用。醒目提示暴雪戰鬥助手建議的下一個法術，這是在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，遊戲仍允許插件讀取的唯一循環建議；你施法或引導時它會等待。同時提醒戰鬥助手留給你處理的部分：戰鬥中的血族之裔與死者復生、對可中斷的施法使用心智冰封，以及戰鬥中只要就緒就使用冰錮堅韌與你的種族冷卻技能。敵人的施法在戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此心智冰封只會在遊戲顯示它們的場合亮起；正式版中生命力是隱藏的，因此何時使用冰錮堅韌由你決定。主動減傷的時機、反魔法護罩、嘲諷與飾品由你自行處理。",
-- 05c7030d English: Reference (Icy Veins and Wowhead)
[2009] = "參考（Icy Veins 與 Wowhead）",
-- 8314e483 English: Reference only, off by default: the guides' Blood priority. In Midnight combat
--     your buffs and the target's debuffs are hidden from addons, so the steps that read them wait
--     there; read it, or clone it to experiment. Health and runic power are hidden on Retail, so
--     Death Strike is used whenever you can afford it. Pulls with Death's Caress. Death Strike;
--     Marrowrend (Death's Caress out of melee) when Bone Shield is missing, under five charges,
--     about to expire, or Exterminate is up; during Gift of the San'layn, Death Strike, one Blood
--     Boil, Death and Decay on Crimson Scourge and Heart Strike; Death and Decay on Crimson Scourge
--     or four enemies; Vampiric Strike; Consumption; Blood Boil on Boiling Point, a missing Blood
--     Plague or full charges; Heart Strike. Reminders: Raise Dead, Vampiric Blood, Reaper's Mark,
--     Dancing Rune Weapon after Reaper's Mark, plus the Assisted premade's utility reminders.
[2010] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：指南中的血魄優先順序。在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，你的增益效果與目標的減益效果都對插件隱藏，因此讀取它們的步驟會在那裡等待；可以閱讀它，或複製後自行實驗。正式版中生命力與符能是隱藏的，因此只要負擔得起就使用死亡打擊。以死亡的撫慰拉怪。死亡打擊；骸骨之盾消失、少於五層、即將結束或消滅生效時使用撕骨裂髓（不在近戰範圍時改用死亡的撫慰）；煞婪贈禮期間，死亡打擊，使用一次沸血術，赤血災禍觸發時使用死亡凋零，以及碎心打擊；赤血災禍觸發或面對四個敵人時使用死亡凋零；吸血打擊；吞噬；沸點觸發、血魄瘟疫消失或充能已滿時使用沸血術；碎心打擊。提醒：死者復生、血族之裔、奪魂印記、在奪魂印記之後使用符文武器幻舞，以及戰鬥助手內建循環中的功能性提醒。",
-- 2b5ecbd1 English: Deathbringer reference (SimulationCraft)
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Death
--     Knight, Retail (current expansion) (variant key: BloodSimc). Names in parentheses (guide or
--     tool such as Icy Veins, Wowhead, SimulationCraft, wowsims, Hekili, Mobalytics, Warcraft
--     Tavern) are proper names and stay unchanged.
[2011] = "死亡召喚者參考（SimulationCraft）",
-- 8ed0754d English: Reference only, off by default: SimulationCraft's Deathbringer list, which
--     spends runic power on Death Strike for damage. Hidden combat data keeps it from running in
--     Midnight combat, and runic power is hidden on Retail, so there is no cap dump. Death and
--     Decay whenever it is down, Reaper's Mark, Marrowrend on Exterminate, Death's Caress for Bone
--     Shield while runes are short (else Marrowrend), Death Strike, Blood Boil, Consumption outside
--     Dancing Rune Weapon, Heart Strike. Reminders: Raise Dead, Dancing Rune Weapon, Vampiric Blood
--     and the utility reminders.
[2012] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：SimulationCraft 的死亡召喚者清單，會把符能花在死亡打擊上來造成傷害。由於戰鬥資料被隱藏，它無法在至暗之夜的戰鬥中運作，而且正式版中符能是隱藏的，因此沒有溢出傾瀉。死亡凋零未生效時隨時使用，奪魂印記，消滅生效時使用撕骨裂髓，符文不足時以死亡的撫慰維持骸骨之盾（否則使用撕骨裂髓），死亡打擊，沸血術，符文武器幻舞以外的時間使用吞噬，碎心打擊。提醒：死者復生、符文武器幻舞、血族之裔以及功能性提醒。",
-- 00b5eb13 English: Blizzard Assisted
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Death
--     Knight, Retail (current expansion) (variant key: Frost). This one follows Blizzard's Assisted
--     Combat suggestion.
[2013] = "暴雪戰鬥助手",
-- 9750dd93 English: Recommended for Frost. Highlights the spell Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests
--     next, the one rotation advice the game still lets an addon read in Midnight combat; it waits
--     while you cast or channel. Alongside it, reminders for what Assisted Combat leaves to you:
--     Breath of Sindragosa and Raise Dead in combat, Mind Freeze on an interruptible cast, and
--     Icebound Fortitude and your racial cooldown whenever they are ready in combat. Enemy casts
--     are hidden in combat, so Mind Freeze lights only where the game shows them; health is hidden
--     on Retail, so when to use Icebound Fortitude is your call.
[2014] = "推薦冰霜專精使用。醒目提示暴雪戰鬥助手建議的下一個法術，這是在至暗之夜的戰鬥中，遊戲仍允許插件讀取的唯一循環建議；你施法或引導時它會等待。同時提醒戰鬥助手留給你處理的部分：戰鬥中的辛德拉苟莎之息與死者復生、對可中斷的施法使用心智冰封，以及戰鬥中只要就緒就使用冰錮堅韌與你的種族冷卻技能。敵人的施法在戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此心智冰封只會在遊戲顯示它們的場合亮起；正式版中生命力是隱藏的，因此何時使用冰錮堅韌由你決定。",
-- c8d06db9 English: Reference (Icy Veins and SimulationCraft)
[2015] = "參考（Icy Veins 與 SimulationCraft）",
-- 91f86ae6 English: Reference only, off by default: the guides' Frost priority. Killing Machine,
--     Rime and Razorice are hidden in Midnight combat, so it cannot run there; runic power is
--     hidden on Retail, so there is no cap check. Obliterate on two Killing Machines or one with
--     three runes, Frost Strike into five Razorice with Shattering Blade, Howling Blast on Rime,
--     Obliterate on Killing Machine, Frost Strike, Obliterate; three or more enemies swap in
--     Frostscythe and Glacial Advance; Howling Blast out of melee. Reminders: Remorseless Winter,
--     Pillar of Frost, Breath of Sindragosa and Frostwyrm's Fury in Pillar, Reaper's Mark, Raise
--     Dead, Empower Rune Weapon at two charges, plus the utility reminders.
[2016] = "僅供參考，預設關閉：指南中的冰霜優先順序。殺戮酷刑、凝霜與冰剃在至暗之夜的戰鬥中會被隱藏，因此它無法在戰鬥中運作；正式版中符能是隱藏的，因此沒有溢出檢查。擁有兩層殺戮酷刑，或一層殺戮酷刑且有三個符文時使用滅寂，有粉碎之刃時在冰剃疊滿五層時使用冰霜打擊，凝霜觸發時使用凜風衝擊，殺戮酷刑觸發時使用滅寂，冰霜打擊，滅寂；三個以上敵人時改用冰霜鐮刀與冰川突進；不在近戰範圍時使用凜風衝擊。提醒：冷酷凜冬、冰霜之柱、在冰霜之柱期間使用辛德拉苟莎之息與冰霜巨龍之怒、奪魂印記、死者復生、在兩層充能時使用強力符文武器，以及功能性提醒。",
-- 0d4e8b80 English: Reference (Wowhead)
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Death
